# References and BibTeX (ai-alignment-literature)

**Canonical mechanics:** [`../../../bib-mcp/docs/styleguide.md`](../../../bib-mcp/docs/styleguide.md)

- **`bib.bib`** at this repo’s root is the **single BibTeX source** for the AI alignment literature cluster (consumers point LaTeX / notes at this file via the sister path `../ai-alignment-literature/bib.bib`).
- **New keys:** `{lastname}{year}_{memorable_snake}` — underscore immediately after the year.
- Prefer open-access `url` / `eprint` when available.

Pair with **[`docs/bibliography-project.md`](../../docs/bibliography-project.md)** for the note tree and ingestion checklist.
